WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.463
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:24.733 --> 00:27.066
I was thinking of inviting you to visit my grandparents.

3
00:27.500 --> 00:28.300
Hello.

4
00:28.866 --> 00:29.933
Did you bring your girlfriend?

5
00:30.266 --> 00:32.966
This is Ms. Chat, my boss.

6
00:33.166 --> 00:35.466
You suddenly brought me all the way here.

7
00:36.133 --> 00:37.666
What's your plan exactly?

8
00:38.133 --> 00:39.200
What plan, Boss?

9
00:39.666 --> 00:40.933
By the way, did you see your mother

10
00:41.766 --> 00:42.900
while you were there?

11
00:43.866 --> 00:48.133
So... What kind of person is Nant's mother, anyway?

12
01:12.566 --> 01:14.049
Don't tease me.

13
01:14.571 --> 01:16.922
I'm trying to sleep.

14
01:19.466 --> 01:22.000
It's morning already, you sleepyhead.

15
01:24.466 --> 01:25.400
Wake up.

16
01:33.166 --> 01:34.400
You're up early.

17
01:41.300 --> 01:42.762
Is there something on my face?

18
01:43.598 --> 01:47.133
Why are you staring at me like that, Boss?

19
01:48.266 --> 01:49.700
You were drooling in your sleep.

20
01:51.300 --> 01:52.133
Really?

21
01:52.966 --> 01:53.766
Oh!

22
01:57.400 --> 01:58.266
Just kidding.

23
01:59.166 --> 02:00.866
You're so easy to fool.

24
02:01.533 --> 02:02.333
There's nothing.

25
02:02.533 --> 02:03.533
You can stop wiping your face now.

26
02:05.866 --> 02:07.700
You're already teasing me so early in the morning, Boss.

27
02:09.766 --> 02:10.566
What?

28
02:11.300 --> 02:12.366
Can't I tease you?

29
02:13.400 --> 02:14.200
You're just...

30
02:14.700 --> 02:16.000
Too fun to tease.

31
02:22.900 --> 02:23.700
Nant.

32
02:24.200 --> 02:25.000
Yes?

33
02:25.766 --> 02:26.766
From now on...

34
02:27.866 --> 02:29.266
Whatever happens to you,

35
02:30.000 --> 02:31.733
or whatever's bothering you,

36
02:32.933 --> 02:34.733
I want you to tell me about it.

37
02:36.200 --> 02:38.066
I want to know everything about you.

38
02:38.600 --> 02:39.400
Okay?

39
02:42.100 --> 02:42.900
Okay.

40
02:44.566 --> 02:46.400
Why is your voice so low?

41
02:47.900 --> 02:51.400
Are you hiding something from me?

42
02:52.366 --> 02:53.166
No.

43
02:54.166 --> 02:54.966
I'm not.

44
02:56.766 --> 02:58.400
Then promise me

45
02:59.133 --> 03:00.700
you'll tell me everything.

46
03:03.166 --> 03:03.966
Okay.

47
03:04.300 --> 03:05.166
I promise.

48
03:06.333 --> 03:08.333
And you have to promise me too, Boss.

49
03:08.933 --> 03:11.366
You'll tell me everything as well.

50
03:12.133 --> 03:12.933
Mm-hmm.

51
03:13.800 --> 03:14.600
I promise.

52
03:15.566 --> 03:16.366
Really?

53
03:16.766 --> 03:18.500
No keeping secrets from each other.

54
03:19.566 --> 03:20.366
Mm-hmm.

55
03:20.733 --> 03:21.533
Of course.

56
03:27.766 --> 03:30.766
Did you sleep well last night?

57
03:32.933 --> 03:33.733
Not at all.

58
03:35.066 --> 03:37.333
Why not?

59
03:38.866 --> 03:40.800
You kept crowding me all night.

60
03:41.900 --> 03:44.166
Come on, the bed is tiny!

61
03:48.700 --> 03:49.533
How about this?

62
03:51.500 --> 03:53.366
Should we try sleeping in a different position?

63
03:55.733 --> 03:56.533
What position?

64
04:26.500 --> 04:28.200
You're the one who asked for it, Nant.

65
04:35.500 --> 04:36.611
Chat.

66
04:37.081 --> 04:38.666
It's still so early.

67
04:39.766 --> 04:41.566
Since when does this kind of thing have a time limit?

68
06:31.466 --> 06:32.933
Massaging your grandpa this early in the morning.

69
06:33.166 --> 06:33.966
What are you after?

70
06:35.733 --> 06:36.533
Wow!

71
06:37.366 --> 06:39.133
You always see right through me, Grandpa.

72
06:39.900 --> 06:40.700
Mm-hmm.

73
06:41.500 --> 06:43.166
I've been meaning to ask you since yesterday.

74
06:43.700 --> 06:44.500
Is something going on?

75
06:44.600 --> 06:46.133
Why did you bring your boss to our house?

76
06:47.533 --> 06:53.466
Oh, I just brought Ms. Chat to take a look at our land.

77
06:54.133 --> 06:55.166
To look at our land?

78
06:55.900 --> 06:56.700
Yes.

79
06:56.800 --> 06:57.666
You wanted her to see it.

80
06:59.100 --> 07:00.766
What for?

81
07:01.933 --> 07:04.868
Well, right now...

82
07:04.868 --> 07:08.200
the company is looking for land to grow bananas, Grandpa.

83
07:12.066 --> 07:13.666
Are you hiding something from me?

84
07:14.666 --> 07:16.900
No, I'm not.

85
07:18.966 --> 07:22.933
Then promise me you'll tell me everything.

86
07:25.866 --> 07:28.400
So, now she saw it

87
07:28.666 --> 07:30.200
Does she like our land?

88
07:31.966 --> 07:32.766
Uh...

89
07:33.733 --> 07:35.700
She doesn't actually know about this yet.

90
07:36.400 --> 07:37.200
Oh.

91
07:38.766 --> 07:40.500
Won't she be upset

92
07:41.100 --> 07:42.266
if she finds out later?

93
07:44.200 --> 07:45.000
Uh...

94
07:45.700 --> 07:47.366
I'm not sure either, Grandpa.

95
07:48.400 --> 07:51.766
Then why don't you just tell her the truth?

96
07:54.400 --> 07:55.900
If I tell her, Grandpa,

97
07:56.466 --> 07:59.333
I'll get an earful for two whole days.

98
08:00.966 --> 08:01.880
How about this...

99
08:01.880 --> 08:05.200
I'll find the right time to tell her later.

100
08:05.666 --> 08:06.466
Is that so?

101
08:06.866 --> 08:07.775
Yes.

102
08:07.775 --> 08:10.356
I'll handle this myself, Grandpa.

103
08:11.192 --> 08:13.884
Boss, look over there.

104
08:13.884 --> 08:18.066
Grandpa and Grandma used to grow bananas all over this land.

105
08:19.300 --> 08:22.100
But they don't do that anymore,

106
08:23.400 --> 08:25.333
so it's gotten all overgrown.

107
08:27.300 --> 08:28.100
Why?

108
08:31.533 --> 08:34.600
Oh, I see.

109
08:37.000 --> 08:42.066
Grandpa, I'm going to take a shower and then head to the market.

110
08:43.066 --> 08:43.615
Go on, go on.

111
08:43.615 --> 08:44.400
Okay.

112
08:51.700 --> 08:52.423
Boss!

113
08:53.468 --> 08:56.400
Come on, get dressed. Let's go to the market.

114
08:56.400 --> 08:57.978
Let's go to the village market.

115
08:57.978 --> 09:01.133
We'll buy some food and cook lunch together.

116
09:05.133 --> 09:05.933
Boss.

117
09:07.400 --> 09:07.916
No.

118
09:08.856 --> 09:09.870
You go with Grandpa.

119
09:10.654 --> 09:11.600
I don't want to go.

120
09:12.600 --> 09:13.100
Huh?

121
09:14.929 --> 09:17.500
What's wrong, Boss?

122
09:19.966 --> 09:23.000
Nothing. I just don't feel like going.

123
09:24.466 --> 09:25.568
Oh, really?

124
09:26.561 --> 09:29.700
Then is there anything special you'd like to eat?

125
09:31.866 --> 09:35.166
No. I'll be heading back in a little while anyway.

126
09:37.566 --> 09:38.366
Oh, really?

127
09:41.466 --> 09:42.266
Okay.

128
09:43.066 --> 09:46.300
Then I'll go to the market first.

129
09:47.500 --> 09:48.300
Mhm.

130
10:25.400 --> 10:28.266
Is something wrong, Chat?

131
10:30.266 --> 10:32.621
Uh, no, Grandma.

132
10:33.143 --> 10:34.500
I'm perfectly fine.

133
10:36.966 --> 10:38.136
Nothing's wrong.

134
10:38.606 --> 10:39.725
But...

135
10:40.261 --> 10:45.113
I saw how coldly you treated Nant just now.

136
10:46.576 --> 10:48.702
If something's bothering you, tell me.

137
10:51.000 --> 10:52.533
I'm really fine, Grandma.

138
10:54.766 --> 10:56.700
It's just that now I realize...

139
10:57.700 --> 10:59.766
we shouldn't expect too much from anyone.

140
11:03.500 --> 11:04.966
As long as you're okay.

141
11:11.000 --> 11:15.000
There's something I want to ask of you, Chat.

142
11:17.400 --> 11:20.566
I want to entrust Nant to your care.

143
11:26.500 --> 11:28.766
I don't think I can be entrusted with your granddaughter anymore.

144
11:30.666 --> 11:31.638
It's okay.

145
11:32.004 --> 11:36.878
I know you're upset right now,

146
11:39.125 --> 11:44.559
but I don't want you to misunderstand Nant.

147
11:47.866 --> 11:51.088
Some people think Nant

148
11:51.558 --> 11:54.187
is just a money-hungry girl.

149
11:55.075 --> 12:01.997
But the truth is, she's the one who takes care of Grandpa and me.

150
12:14.400 --> 12:15.200
Hey!

151
12:15.933 --> 12:17.900
Damn Sak wouldn't get off my back about that card debt.

152
12:18.100 --> 12:20.066
Good thing Boss Chai bailed me out.

153
12:25.733 --> 12:26.533
Nant!

154
12:28.000 --> 12:29.900
Change your clothes and go see Boss Chai!

155
12:44.800 --> 12:46.200
Why do I have to go see him?

156
12:46.733 --> 12:49.333
Because he bought you from me!

157
12:53.600 --> 12:54.400
No!

158
12:55.933 --> 12:56.733
I'm not going!

159
12:57.400 --> 12:58.200
You have to go!

160
12:58.466 --> 12:59.266
I'm not going!

161
12:59.300 --> 13:00.333
If you don't go,

162
13:00.566 --> 13:01.900
we'll all starve to death!

163
13:02.100 --> 13:02.900
I'm not going!

164
13:03.266 --> 13:04.333
I said go.

165
13:04.600 --> 13:05.400
Yot, take her!

166
13:05.800 --> 13:06.989
Why do I have to go see Hia Chai?

167
13:06.989 --> 13:07.714
Go!

168
13:07.714 --> 13:08.442
Go!

169
13:08.442 --> 13:08.942
I'm not going!

170
13:09.000 --> 13:09.766
Go! You have to go!

171
13:09.766 --> 13:10.266
I'm not going!

172
13:10.266 --> 13:11.100
Go! I told you to go!

173
13:11.200 --> 13:12.000
I'm not going!

174
13:12.500 --> 13:14.066
Can you shut up?!

175
13:14.266 --> 13:14.766
Hey!

176
13:14.766 --> 13:16.100
I said go!

177
13:16.266 --> 13:16.766
I said go!

178
13:16.766 --> 13:17.266
Go!

179
13:17.333 --> 13:17.933
I'm not going!

180
13:17.933 --> 13:18.486
Go!

181
13:18.486 --> 13:19.700
I'm not going!

182
13:19.900 --> 13:20.700
Watch where you're going.

183
13:21.566 --> 13:22.466
Mom,I don't want to go!

184
13:23.533 --> 13:24.333
Stand up straight!

185
13:24.600 --> 13:25.400
Mom!

186
13:26.735 --> 13:27.899
I'm not going!

187
13:27.899 --> 13:29.500
Mom!

188
13:29.500 --> 13:33.300
Remember this. Your only purpose is to make money for me.

189
13:33.666 --> 13:34.333
No.

190
13:34.333 --> 13:37.366
Just think of it as paying me back for pushing you out.

191
13:38.500 --> 13:39.300
Go!

192
13:41.800 --> 13:42.600
Please.

193
13:43.133 --> 13:43.933
No!

194
13:58.666 --> 13:59.466
Help!

195
13:59.900 --> 14:00.700
Help!

196
14:01.600 --> 14:02.466
Please help me!

197
14:06.766 --> 14:09.536
Please help me!

198
14:10.000 --> 14:11.997
Help me, please!

199
14:22.766 --> 14:26.400
Hey, Nant. What's wrong? Why are you running?

200
14:26.578 --> 14:28.447
Can you take me to Grandma's?

201
14:28.447 --> 14:33.400
Okay, okay. Don't be scared. I'll take you there.

202
14:35.300 --> 14:36.366
Why were you running away?

203
14:48.500 --> 14:50.600
It's okay. Don't be scared. I'll take you there.

204
15:00.666 --> 15:02.933
Nant! Come with me right now!

205
15:03.400 --> 15:04.933
Nee! Where are you taking my granddaughter?

206
15:05.966 --> 15:06.466
Nee!

207
15:06.466 --> 15:07.639
Mom, what are you doing?!

208
15:07.639 --> 15:08.139
Ow!

209
15:08.333 --> 15:09.133
Come with me right now!

210
15:09.300 --> 15:11.000
You can't just take her away again!

211
15:11.700 --> 15:13.566
She's my daughter. I can do whatever I want with her!

212
15:14.200 --> 15:14.866
Come on!

213
15:14.866 --> 15:15.966
Stay out of this, Mom!

214
15:17.800 --> 15:18.866
Go home, Nee!

215
15:19.700 --> 15:20.500
I'm not going back.

216
15:20.766 --> 15:21.800
If you want me to go back,

217
15:21.933 --> 15:23.200
I'm taking Nant with me.

218
15:23.700 --> 15:25.533
But you don't want her to go with me, do you?

219
15:25.938 --> 15:28.330
Then hand over the title deed to this land in exchange.

220
15:48.500 --> 15:49.533
I'd rather lose everything

221
15:49.866 --> 15:51.733
than let my granddaughter go through hell again.

222
15:51.933 --> 15:52.766
Take it!

223
15:57.533 --> 15:58.333
Mom.

224
15:58.466 --> 15:59.566
Don't worry about me.

225
15:59.800 --> 16:02.866
I promise I'll never set foot in this house again.

226
16:04.600 --> 16:05.533
Come on, darling.

227
16:06.066 --> 16:07.366
You ungrateful brat!

228
16:14.900 --> 16:16.758
My poor girl...

229
16:17.755 --> 16:19.013
I'm sorry.

230
16:24.300 --> 16:25.000
Hello.

231
16:25.000 --> 16:26.866
Oh, hello there, Chief.

232
16:26.866 --> 16:27.666
Hello.

233
16:28.300 --> 16:31.133
I came here today to tell you something.

234
16:31.666 --> 16:33.800
If Grandma pays back the 600,000 baht you owe me,

235
16:34.300 --> 16:35.933
I'll return the land title to her.

236
16:36.666 --> 16:38.133
But there's something else I want to say.

237
16:38.866 --> 16:41.066
I'll even waive all the interest. How about that?

238
16:42.300 --> 16:43.133
That's very kind of you.

239
16:43.900 --> 16:44.700
Thank you so much.

240
16:45.266 --> 16:47.300
Of course. We should help each other.

241
16:49.600 --> 16:51.466
I'll find a way to pay you back, Uncle.

242
16:57.333 --> 16:59.800
I'll get the land back for you, I promise.

243
17:02.366 --> 17:03.733
That's my girl.

244
17:17.566 --> 17:18.900
Ever since that day,

245
17:21.266 --> 17:26.566
Nant has felt like she's carrying a heavy burden in her heart.

246
17:29.000 --> 17:31.796
She wants to buy back the rice field

247
17:31.796 --> 17:34.686
so Grandpa can take care of it.

248
17:36.515 --> 17:38.114
And also to make up for...

249
17:39.107 --> 17:41.100
the mistake their parents caused.

250
17:52.666 --> 17:53.618
Chat...

251
17:54.872 --> 17:58.535
You can be angry with her. You can hate her.

252
18:00.677 --> 18:03.600
But please don't hurt her.

253
18:09.500 --> 18:11.166
I used to think badly of Nant too.

254
18:13.333 --> 18:14.133
But now...

255
18:16.333 --> 18:17.900
I understand, Grandma.

256
19:02.933 --> 19:03.733
Grandma!

257
19:05.366 --> 19:06.166
Grandma!

258
19:07.266 --> 19:08.066
Huh?

259
19:08.666 --> 19:10.300
Why is the house so quiet?

260
19:10.300 --> 19:11.066
Yeah.

261
19:11.566 --> 19:12.700
It's really quiet.

262
19:22.300 --> 19:23.100
Uh...

263
19:24.400 --> 19:25.500
What's going on here?

264
19:27.666 --> 19:28.666
Open it and see.

265
19:39.566 --> 19:40.733
It's the land title.

266
19:41.566 --> 19:44.300
I just took Grandma to get it back from Chief.

267
19:47.800 --> 19:48.600
Boss...

268
19:51.200 --> 19:52.400
Why did you do that?

269
19:53.933 --> 19:54.733
Why?

270
19:55.300 --> 19:57.266
Didn't you want me to use your land

271
19:57.733 --> 19:59.566
for the banana-growing project?

272
20:00.066 --> 20:01.566
If someone else still owned it,

273
20:01.966 --> 20:02.966
how could I lease it?

274
20:04.900 --> 20:05.900
How did you know?

275
20:07.766 --> 20:11.166
I overheard you talking to Grandpa earlier.

276
20:20.966 --> 20:23.600
Uh, I'll go prepare lunch.

277
20:24.600 --> 20:26.500
(Grandpa) Bring the stuff here. (Grandma) I'll carry them.

278
20:27.000 --> 20:28.701
I'll help you carry these. Come on.

279
20:28.701 --> 20:30.202
Let's put everything upstairs.

280
20:30.202 --> 20:30.889
Come on, Grandma.

281
20:30.889 --> 20:31.600
I'll start cooking, dear.

282
20:33.800 --> 20:36.900
I bought so much stuff.

283
20:42.533 --> 20:43.333
Well...

284
20:44.166 --> 20:45.466
Is there something you want to tell me?

285
20:49.266 --> 20:50.066
Boss...

286
20:51.900 --> 20:52.966
I'm sorry.

287
20:55.533 --> 20:59.766
I admit I really did bring you here to look at the land.

288
21:01.700 --> 21:04.825
Mm-hmm. I figured

289
21:05.452 --> 21:08.966
you were hiding something from me, you little brat.

290
21:11.400 --> 21:12.466
You knew?

291
21:14.200 --> 21:14.790
Yes.

292
21:16.044 --> 21:20.100
But I never thought you'd be this cruel to me.

293
21:24.966 --> 21:26.600
If you'd just told me the truth,

294
21:27.566 --> 21:29.466
I would've been willing to help you, Nant.

295
21:32.933 --> 21:35.900
I was afraid you'd hate me, Boss.

296
21:37.700 --> 21:38.500
I...

297
21:39.166 --> 21:41.700
I didn't want you to think I was some money-hungry woman.

298
21:44.766 --> 21:47.133
I've never thought of you that way.

299
21:48.300 --> 21:50.600
And I'm not mad at you or hate you for it either.

300
21:52.366 --> 21:53.933
But what you did...

301
21:55.200 --> 21:56.933
it still hurt my feelings a little.

302
22:03.766 --> 22:05.700
You wouldn't tell me anything.

303
22:07.466 --> 22:09.533
Don't ever do this again.

304
22:10.166 --> 22:10.966
Do you understand?

305
22:13.133 --> 22:14.366
I'm sorry, Boss.

306
22:16.800 --> 22:19.133
What about the land, then?

307
22:21.333 --> 22:23.296
I didn't buy the land back for you.

308
22:24.236 --> 22:24.791
The land...

309
22:25.575 --> 22:27.375
I'm leasing the land to grow bananas for five years,

310
22:27.375 --> 22:29.022
for a total of 600,000 baht.

311
22:30.000 --> 22:31.860
As for the money you've been paying in earlier installments,

312
22:32.800 --> 22:34.933
I've put all of it into Grandma's bank account.

313
22:37.000 --> 22:38.290
Wow.

314
22:38.551 --> 22:41.700
I'll find a way to pay boss back in full.

315
22:43.366 --> 22:44.089
How?

316
22:44.716 --> 22:46.533
By taking those odd jobs?

317
22:49.366 --> 22:53.357
I don't want you doing anything dangerous like that again.

318
22:53.879 --> 22:55.477
No more fake-girlfriend gigs.

319
22:55.999 --> 22:57.666
No more getting paid to break couples up.

320
22:57.666 --> 23:00.993
And no more dangerous jobs of any kind.

321
23:01.515 --> 23:02.366
Understand?

322
23:04.166 --> 23:06.200
Then where am I supposed to get the money?

323
23:08.533 --> 23:09.400
From me.

324
23:12.700 --> 23:15.733
Let me be...the only one who hires you.

325
23:29.600 --> 23:30.400
Why?

326
23:32.500 --> 23:34.510
What's wrong with that?

327
23:35.712 --> 23:39.245
If I'm your hirer, I'll pay whatever you ask.

328
23:39.245 --> 23:41.828
It's better than you putting yourself in danger again.

329
23:45.933 --> 23:47.266
Are you worried about me, Boss?

330
23:53.266 --> 23:54.066
Mm-hmm.

331
23:58.300 --> 23:59.100
Wow.

332
24:02.166 --> 24:04.000
Now that we've finished discussing business...

333
24:07.566 --> 24:09.333
Shall we continue this in bed?

334
24:15.100 --> 24:17.966
Sure. You're feeling better now, right?

335
24:25.366 --> 24:26.166
No.

336
24:26.600 --> 24:27.400
Actually, never mind.

337
24:28.100 --> 24:29.400
I'm going to punish you, Boss.

338
24:31.200 --> 24:33.200
About you doing things without telling me.

339
24:34.800 --> 24:36.766
You're quite the grudge-holder, aren't you?

340
24:40.700 --> 24:42.066
But thank you, Boss.

341
24:43.133 --> 24:43.933
Thank you.

342
24:47.366 --> 24:48.166
Thank you.

343
24:48.966 --> 24:52.066
I only did it for your grandparents.

344
25:02.000 --> 25:03.966
Come on, let's go inside.

345
25:07.766 --> 25:08.566
Let's go.

346
25:09.600 --> 25:10.400
No.

347
25:10.600 --> 25:11.290
Come on.

348
25:11.290 --> 25:12.400
You wouldn't let me kiss you earlier.

349
25:14.866 --> 25:15.666
Come on.

350
25:26.266 --> 25:28.466
Uh, I'm here for my scheduled internal examination.

351
25:28.566 --> 25:30.733
Oh, sure. Please have a seat and wait a moment.

352
25:30.966 --> 25:31.766
Okay.

353
25:59.300 --> 26:00.900
If you keep ignoring me like this,

354
26:01.500 --> 26:02.966
I'll kiss you right here.

355
26:03.333 --> 26:04.666
Kirin Ham Cheese.

356
26:06.466 --> 26:07.700
We don't even know each other.

357
26:09.466 --> 26:10.266
Don't know each other?

358
26:11.900 --> 26:14.300
Yet we kissed until our lips were raw?

359
26:15.000 --> 26:15.800
Hey, Doc!

360
26:16.800 --> 26:18.066
What the hell are you talking about?

361
26:19.266 --> 26:20.666
With a memory that short,

362
26:22.100 --> 26:23.533
I guess I'll have to refresh it.

363
26:27.266 --> 26:29.026
Our lips just bumped into each other.

364
26:29.026 --> 26:30.973
That's not called a kiss.

365
26:31.391 --> 26:32.700
It was an accident.

366
26:33.600 --> 26:34.706
Oh, really?

367
26:36.639 --> 26:39.266
Then, would you like to try a French kiss?

368
26:44.800 --> 26:47.517
So, what's it going to be?

369
26:47.517 --> 26:49.499
Do you know me or not?

370
26:50.962 --> 26:53.800
It's your choice. If you say you don't know me,

371
26:55.266 --> 26:57.695
next time I'll give you a special internal exam.

372
26:58.531 --> 27:02.333
No instruments. Just my fingers and...

373
27:02.666 --> 27:03.466
Okay, okay!

374
27:04.566 --> 27:05.500
Fine! I know you.

375
27:07.500 --> 27:08.200
That's all it took.

376
27:08.200 --> 27:09.266
What do you want from me?

377
27:09.766 --> 27:10.766
You perverted doctor.

378
27:12.066 --> 27:13.166
Nothing much.

379
27:13.766 --> 27:15.333
I just wanted to ask you out for a meal.

380
27:16.733 --> 27:17.933
Don't you have any friends?

381
27:19.133 --> 27:20.666
I do, but none of them will come.

382
27:24.366 --> 27:26.733
Even your own friends won't hang out with you.

383
27:30.533 --> 27:33.366
Oh, Dr. Air, you know this girl?

384
27:34.166 --> 27:34.966
No, I don't.

385
27:35.800 --> 27:37.370
There you go again.

386
27:37.683 --> 27:39.900
I just gave you an internal exam just a few days ago.

387
27:40.933 --> 27:43.533
Fine! I know you.

388
27:45.300 --> 27:48.333
Uh, Ni, you can head back now.

389
27:48.566 --> 27:49.266
Sure.

390
27:49.266 --> 27:51.266
I need to talk to Dr. Ai for a bit.

391
27:51.400 --> 27:52.986
Okay, take your time.

392
27:52.986 --> 27:53.566
I'm off.

393
27:54.133 --> 27:54.753
Bye.

394
27:54.753 --> 27:55.253
Let's go.

395
27:59.166 --> 28:01.733
What's with them? When did these two get so close?

396
28:14.566 --> 28:15.366
Hey, Doc.

397
28:17.100 --> 28:18.800
Why did you drag me here?

398
28:20.066 --> 28:21.300
Taking a trip down memory lane?

399
28:22.966 --> 28:23.766
Exactly.

400
28:24.400 --> 28:25.333
We still haven't settled

401
28:26.166 --> 28:27.366
what happened that day.

402
28:29.866 --> 28:30.666
Well...

403
28:30.733 --> 28:31.800
Then hurry up and settle it.

404
28:32.533 --> 28:33.333
So I can go home.

405
28:34.400 --> 28:35.200
Hmm.

406
28:35.566 --> 28:37.200
How should I settle it?

407
28:40.100 --> 28:41.533
That feeling from the other day...

408
28:42.500 --> 28:44.533
I can still feel it on my lips.

409
28:47.133 --> 28:49.333
What? Still thinking about it?

410
28:49.933 --> 28:50.733
Mm-hmm.

411
28:52.333 --> 28:55.333
Hey, Doc. What are you so hung up on?

412
28:56.100 --> 28:59.082
I can't help it.

413
28:59.082 --> 29:01.719
Because of your kiss, little girl.

414
29:04.866 --> 29:05.900
Are you a pervert or something?

415
29:06.866 --> 29:07.700
A little.

416
29:08.700 --> 29:09.500
I missed you.

417
29:10.200 --> 29:11.900
So I wanted to treat you to a meal to make it up to you.

418
29:14.800 --> 29:16.000
What are you making it up for?

419
29:16.966 --> 29:18.348
Everything.

420
29:18.870 --> 29:21.235
The ham and cheese, the French fries...

421
29:21.235 --> 29:23.323
Everything I did that upset you.

422
29:23.323 --> 29:25.200
I just wanted to take you out for a meal.

423
29:27.866 --> 29:31.559
So you think buying me dinner

424
29:31.559 --> 29:33.466
will make up for everything?

425
29:34.766 --> 29:37.166
Or would you prefer a different kind of apology?

426
29:38.066 --> 29:39.700
Like...

427
29:39.700 --> 29:41.066
Kissing you back?

428
29:41.600 --> 29:44.866
Enough. Just buy me dinner.

429
29:46.966 --> 29:48.733
I'll eat until I'm stuffed. Just you wait.

430
29:49.933 --> 29:50.733
Be my guest.

431
29:53.566 --> 29:59.366
So, why didn't you invite your girlfriend instead?

432
29:59.933 --> 30:00.766
I'm single.

433
30:04.933 --> 30:05.800
You're good-looking.

434
30:07.300 --> 30:08.966
I never thought you'd still be single.

435
30:10.533 --> 30:12.933
I'd rather stay single forever than end up with a player.

436
30:14.966 --> 30:15.766
Kirin...

437
30:19.200 --> 30:21.466
I think I'm going to pursue you.

438
30:49.600 --> 30:50.400
Just a second.

439
30:55.866 --> 30:56.366
Ow.

440
30:56.366 --> 30:56.966
Careful.

441
30:59.700 --> 31:00.545
Are you okay?

442
31:01.590 --> 31:03.236
I'm fine.

443
31:06.100 --> 31:07.166
Go sit down.

444
31:19.300 --> 31:20.466
I've brought you home.

445
31:21.566 --> 31:22.700
Now I can leave.

446
31:29.800 --> 31:30.600
No.

447
31:31.266 --> 31:32.066
Hey!

448
31:34.333 --> 31:35.266
I'm not letting you go.

449
31:36.400 --> 31:37.500
Stay the night.

450
31:38.100 --> 31:39.466
I don't want to be alone.

451
31:40.600 --> 31:41.400
Hey, Doc.

452
31:42.200 --> 31:43.900
You're not exactly young anymore.

453
31:44.700 --> 31:45.933
Stop acting like a child.

454
31:50.100 --> 31:50.900
Let go.

455
31:52.600 --> 31:54.166
You're drunk and talking nonsense.

456
32:12.900 --> 32:14.400
I'm not that drunk.

457
32:19.066 --> 32:19.866
How can you say you're not drunk?

458
32:21.533 --> 32:23.666
Do you even realize what you're doing?

459
32:27.266 --> 32:28.066
Of course I do.

460
32:29.800 --> 32:30.600
Kirin...

461
32:32.100 --> 32:33.800
Can you kiss me one more time?

462
32:35.800 --> 32:37.533
A real kiss, not an accident.

463
32:50.133 --> 32:51.800
Why should I kiss you?

464
32:52.733 --> 32:53.533
Are you crazy?

465
33:02.566 --> 33:03.733
Then you should go home.

466
33:05.666 --> 33:06.733
I can manage on my own.

467
33:28.366 --> 33:30.133
Hey, Doc. Are you really going to pursue me?

468
33:36.866 --> 33:37.666
Yes.

469
33:45.309 --> 33:46.679
I'm serious.

470
35:32.066 --> 35:34.800
Are you sure you want to do this?

471
35:37.800 --> 35:40.466
If you let me, then I'm sure.

472
35:45.200 --> 35:46.766
I won't let you down.

473
36:48.133 --> 36:50.500
Hey! What the hell is going on here?

474
36:54.600 --> 36:56.000
What should we do?

475
36:56.600 --> 36:59.300
Obviously, we have to fix it! Why even ask?

476
37:01.800 --> 37:03.366
What about my room being broken into?

477
37:03.666 --> 37:05.280
Have you checked yet?

478
37:05.280 --> 37:06.766
Did anything of yours go missing?

479
37:07.500 --> 37:08.300
Nothing.

480
37:09.500 --> 37:10.700
I don't have anything valuable.

481
37:11.700 --> 37:13.466
What the hell? Someone broke into

482
37:13.800 --> 37:15.200
the room but didn't take anything?

483
37:16.066 --> 37:16.866
Huh?

484
37:16.966 --> 37:19.466
Could it have been one of your creditors?

485
37:20.100 --> 37:21.700
Do you have security footage we can check?

486
37:22.066 --> 37:22.866
No cameras.

487
37:23.166 --> 37:24.266
You know that already.

488
37:26.666 --> 37:27.500
Then let's report it to the police.

489
37:27.866 --> 37:28.666
Hey, hey, hey!

490
37:29.000 --> 37:31.866
Don't get the police involved in my apartment building!

491
37:32.100 --> 37:33.000
You know how it is here.

492
37:33.166 --> 37:34.500
You know who lives in my building.

493
37:35.066 --> 37:37.000
If the police start hanging around,

494
37:37.266 --> 37:39.333
all my tenants will be scared away!

495
37:39.566 --> 37:40.366
Huh?

496
37:40.466 --> 37:43.533
So what am I supposed to do? I'm the victim here!

497
37:43.766 --> 37:46.724
Hey, hey! I'm the victim here!

498
37:47.312 --> 37:49.287
Just look at all the stuff in this room!

499
37:49.630 --> 37:52.866
I rented you the room, and now you've gone and wrecked it!

500
37:54.366 --> 37:55.166
The repair costs...

501
37:55.400 --> 37:56.666
You're responsible for them.

502
37:58.533 --> 38:01.100
Uh, it comes to 25,000 baht in total.

503
38:03.000 --> 38:03.800
What?

504
38:04.800 --> 38:05.600
25,000?

505
38:06.166 --> 38:06.966
Hey!

506
38:07.066 --> 38:08.566
And let me warn you.

507
38:08.766 --> 38:10.566
If you go to the police,

508
38:10.866 --> 38:12.400
I'll kick you out immediately!

509
38:13.400 --> 38:15.166
I'll have a repairman come tomorrow.

510
38:15.700 --> 38:17.866
You'd better get the money ready.

511
38:18.466 --> 38:19.266
Otherwise...

512
38:19.500 --> 38:22.800
Pack your things and get the hell out of my building!

513
38:23.566 --> 38:24.533
That's final!

514
39:16.966 --> 39:17.926
Good Lord!

515
39:18.448 --> 39:20.533
You look like a walking corpse, Nant.

516
39:21.366 --> 39:24.700
Yeah, did Boss Chat suck the life right out of you?

517
39:26.566 --> 39:27.714
You don't look any better.

518
39:27.714 --> 39:29.766
You look like you haven't slept all night, Ki.

519
39:32.266 --> 39:34.024
Whatever. Leave me alone.

520
39:35.278 --> 39:37.766
Anyway, what's going on with you?

521
39:40.500 --> 39:41.788
Hey...

522
39:42.624 --> 39:43.966
My room got broken into.

523
39:44.200 --> 39:45.700
What? Someone broke in?

524
39:47.000 --> 39:51.666
Yeah, but here's the weird part. Nothing was stolen.

525
39:52.500 --> 39:56.200
Oh, Nant doesn't have anything valuable, huh?

526
39:56.500 --> 39:58.133
Poor burglar!

527
39:59.666 --> 40:01.066
When are you getting it fixed?

528
40:02.166 --> 40:05.533
The landlord's making me pay for the repairs.

529
40:06.966 --> 40:07.766
Sigh...

530
40:07.866 --> 40:08.666
How much?

531
40:12.786 --> 40:13.333
What?!

532
40:14.766 --> 40:15.566
25,000?!

533
40:16.400 --> 40:17.533
Why is it so expensive?

534
40:18.000 --> 40:18.966
What the hell needs fixing?

535
40:19.566 --> 40:22.100
If I can't come up with the money,

536
40:22.766 --> 40:23.566
I'll...

537
40:24.266 --> 40:26.700
end up sleeping under a bridge.

538
40:36.666 --> 40:37.664
Hey...

539
40:38.395 --> 40:41.556
Could you lend me 25,000?

540
40:42.287 --> 40:45.351
I'll pay you back at the end of the month.

541
40:51.900 --> 40:53.990
Look at this.

542
40:53.990 --> 40:55.419
Ever since the wedding,

543
40:55.419 --> 40:58.357
Ma's punished me by giving me only 500 baht a day.

544
40:58.357 --> 41:01.366
I'm about to cry just talking about it.

545
41:03.933 --> 41:05.333
But I have 10,000 saved up.

546
41:06.000 --> 41:06.853
You can take that for now.

547
41:06.853 --> 41:08.333
Oh! No, I can't.

548
41:09.133 --> 41:10.166
How could I?

549
41:10.533 --> 41:12.366
I know that's your savings.

550
41:13.700 --> 41:15.100
You still have tuition to pay.

551
41:15.966 --> 41:16.766
I can't take it.

552
41:17.666 --> 41:18.600
What am I going to do?

553
41:25.900 --> 41:27.900
I know where you can get the money.

554
41:29.333 --> 41:30.133
Where?

555
41:30.266 --> 41:31.666
Boss Chat, obviously.

556
41:32.400 --> 41:33.600
Pleeease, Boss Chat!

557
41:34.333 --> 41:35.766
Someone broke into Nant's room.

558
41:36.166 --> 41:37.666
Could you give her some money to fix it?

559
41:38.800 --> 41:39.600
Yeah, actually.

560
41:40.133 --> 41:41.400
25,000 baht is nothing to her.

561
41:42.466 --> 41:44.000
It's pocket change.

562
41:46.666 --> 41:49.733
No way. Boss Chat has already helped me so much.

563
41:55.333 --> 41:56.666
How can I ask her for money?

564
41:57.600 --> 42:01.500
I just managed to prove to her that I'm not some money-hungry woman.

565
42:02.933 --> 42:03.733
Besides...

566
42:04.966 --> 42:07.000
Boss already told me not to take any more jobs.

567
42:08.466 --> 42:11.000
And now you want me to go begging her for money?

568
42:16.300 --> 42:18.333
Sorry. I didn't think before I spoke.

569
42:25.966 --> 42:28.080
Look at you, Miss Good, Miss Hard-Worker.

570
42:28.080 --> 42:29.933
You're about to be homeless tomorrow.

571
42:30.166 --> 42:31.464
Oh, shut up.

572
42:31.464 --> 42:33.133
You're just teasing her!

573
42:36.733 --> 42:37.733
It's okay.

574
42:40.766 --> 42:41.666
What am I supposed to do?

575
42:44.100 --> 42:44.966
Come here. There, there.

576
42:45.400 --> 42:47.100
It's okay.

577
43:02.612 --> 43:03.909
(Hello, Ms. Nant.)

578
43:04.448 --> 43:05.548
(My name is Wasu.)

579
43:05.842 --> 43:09.705
(I need someone to accompany me to a business tycoon's daughter's party tonight.)

580
43:09.705 --> 43:11.096
(It's a formal event.)

581
43:11.586 --> 43:14.594
(You'll need to wear an evening gown and mingle with the guests.)

582
43:14.985 --> 43:17.692
(I'd like you to attend as my daughter.)

583
43:18.062 --> 43:21.468
(The fee is 35,000 baht. Would you be interested?)

584
43:21.933 --> 43:22.733
Wow!

585
43:23.333 --> 43:24.900
Why is the pay so high?

586
43:27.900 --> 43:30.133
It must be a pretty formal event, huh?

587
43:37.700 --> 43:39.498
No more fake-girlfriend gigs.

588
43:39.498 --> 43:41.548
No more getting paid to break couples up.

589
43:41.548 --> 43:44.866
And no more dangerous jobs of any kind.

590
43:51.000 --> 43:53.133
But if I don't take this job...

591
43:54.500 --> 43:56.666
I'll have nowhere to live.

592
44:08.016 --> 44:10.016
(Thitinant's Account Info)

593
44:11.184 --> 44:12.498
(Deposit received: 10,000 baht)

594
44:12.900 --> 44:13.700
Wow.

595
44:23.766 --> 44:29.266
I promise this will be my last job.

596
44:42.666 --> 44:43.966
It's a pleasure doing business with you.

597
44:44.300 --> 44:45.100
Likewise.

598
45:07.866 --> 45:11.600
Uh, was there a problem with the meeting just now, Boss?

599
45:14.000 --> 45:15.366
Oh, no.

600
45:26.700 --> 45:31.566
If there's anything you need help with, just let me know, Boss.

601
45:36.200 --> 45:37.133
Anything at all?

602
45:38.100 --> 45:39.166
Work-related matters only.

603
45:39.933 --> 45:40.918
It's me, Chom.

604
45:40.918 --> 45:41.418
I knew it.

605
45:41.766 --> 45:44.466
Chat, I can help you with anything.

606
45:45.266 --> 45:46.066
No, thanks.

607
45:46.766 --> 45:48.066
I'd rather ask Hanna.

608
45:49.300 --> 45:52.000
But this isn't work-related.

609
45:53.933 --> 45:55.466
I wanted to ask you something.

610
45:56.200 --> 45:57.000
Oh...

611
45:57.266 --> 45:58.566
It's about a friend of mine.

612
45:59.066 --> 45:59.866
It's not about me.

613
46:00.300 --> 46:00.800
Okay.

614
46:00.800 --> 46:01.900
Which friend?

615
46:03.266 --> 46:03.766
Ugh!

616
46:03.766 --> 46:04.333
Hmph!

617
46:04.533 --> 46:05.927
I said it's a friend, so it's a friend!

618
46:05.927 --> 46:06.600
Okay.

619
46:07.266 --> 46:10.497
Let's say...

620
46:11.072 --> 46:15.826
If two people have feelings for each other and they're apart,

621
46:16.296 --> 46:17.766
would one of them usually reach out first?

622
46:18.866 --> 46:19.666
Hmm.

623
46:21.866 --> 46:23.649
If they know Boss is busy,

624
46:23.649 --> 46:27.166
maybe they want to wait until Boss is free?

625
46:29.933 --> 46:32.067
But if it were me,

626
46:32.067 --> 46:36.166
I'd text every second, every breath.

627
46:36.933 --> 46:38.166
That'd be so annoying.

628
46:39.100 --> 46:42.966
Hanna, are you talking about me? That hurts.

629
46:49.933 --> 46:50.766
Forget it.

630
47:00.500 --> 47:04.266
Hanna, do you think Chat has a girlfriend?

631
47:17.946 --> 47:19.946
(Mom, Chat definitely has a girlfriend.)

632
47:20.396 --> 47:21.766
Shit!

633
47:21.766 --> 47:22.566
Wrong chat!

634
47:26.050 --> 47:28.050
(Oh, I didn't know I had a girlfriend.)

635
47:28.051 --> 47:30.051
(Congratulations.)

636
47:37.800 --> 47:38.600
No need to delete it.

637
47:39.500 --> 47:40.566
Everyone's already read it.

638
47:41.400 --> 47:42.866
You must have a lot of free time, Chom.

639
47:43.533 --> 47:47.800
Then you're coming to work tomorrow. Clock in at the office every morning.

640
47:48.366 --> 47:49.566
Oh, Chat!

641
47:50.333 --> 47:51.366
Hmph! No way.

642
47:51.800 --> 47:52.600
Yes, you will.

643
47:52.933 --> 47:53.733
Chat!

644
48:20.300 --> 48:22.000
There's a party inside, right?

645
48:22.533 --> 48:23.333
Yeah.

646
48:24.666 --> 48:25.800
Are you sure this is safe?

647
48:26.966 --> 48:29.266
The payment is suspiciously high.

648
48:29.700 --> 48:31.566
That's why I brought you guys along.

649
48:32.200 --> 48:34.300
Yeah, good thinking. Don't let your guard down.

650
48:44.133 --> 48:44.933
Hello.

651
48:45.366 --> 48:46.166
Hello.

652
48:47.066 --> 48:48.266
Are you Ms. Nant?

653
48:48.466 --> 48:49.166
Yes.

654
48:49.166 --> 48:50.333
I'm Wasu.

655
48:51.100 --> 48:54.000
I'm the one who suddenly hired you to play my daughter.

656
48:54.466 --> 48:55.621
Hello, Mr. Wasu.

657
48:55.621 --> 48:59.066
Oh, it's no trouble at all. I'm more than happy to do it.

658
49:00.366 --> 49:01.933
Uh, and who are these two?

659
49:02.566 --> 49:04.700
Oh, they're my friends.

660
49:06.366 --> 49:07.503
What should we do?

661
49:07.503 --> 49:09.966
I'm afraid you can't enter without an invitation.

662
49:10.566 --> 49:11.366
Oh...

663
49:13.066 --> 49:14.399
That's all right.

664
49:14.765 --> 49:16.342
We're just here to drop Nant off.

665
49:16.342 --> 49:18.566
Seeing that you're here puts my mind at ease.

666
49:19.733 --> 49:20.533
Right.

667
49:21.666 --> 49:23.366
(Nant) Well, let's go inside. (Kirin) Hey!

668
49:26.300 --> 49:28.031
If anything seems suspicious

669
49:28.031 --> 49:29.480
or you feel uncomfortable,

670
49:29.480 --> 49:30.800
call us, okay?

671
49:31.700 --> 49:33.700
Yeah, I doubt anything will happen.

672
49:35.100 --> 49:38.666
There are plenty of people around. I'll call if anything comes up.

673
49:39.000 --> 49:40.100
Take care of yourself.

674
49:42.100 --> 49:43.066
Are you worried about me?

675
49:43.733 --> 49:45.133
Shall we go, Dad?

676
49:45.300 --> 49:46.100
Of course.

677
49:50.533 --> 49:52.466
You're almost done with university, aren't you, Nant?

678
49:53.666 --> 49:56.966
Oh, yes. I'm doing my internship right now.

679
49:57.266 --> 49:58.666
Wow, that must be exhausting.

680
49:58.966 --> 50:01.466
Not at all. I really enjoy working.

681
50:02.733 --> 50:06.100
Aren't you afraid of taking jobs like this?

682
50:07.300 --> 50:09.533
Oh, I guess I've been lucky.

683
50:10.366 --> 50:12.133
I've only ever had good clients.

684
50:12.700 --> 50:14.078
I see.

685
50:14.078 --> 50:16.712
Once the event is over,

686
50:16.712 --> 50:20.300
I'll transfer the rest of your payment right away.

687
50:20.900 --> 50:21.700
Okay.

688
50:22.133 --> 50:22.900
Let's go.

689
50:22.900 --> 50:23.700
Okay.

690
50:27.966 --> 50:29.123
Oh...

691
50:30.272 --> 50:31.671
Where are we going?

692
50:31.671 --> 50:36.200
Isn't the party on the fifth floor?

693
50:37.600 --> 50:40.318
Well, I'd like to take you

694
50:40.318 --> 50:42.039
to meet my wife first.

695
50:42.039 --> 50:44.533
We need to go over a few more details.

696
50:51.133 --> 50:54.000
Oh, I think we can talk right here.

697
50:55.466 --> 50:57.509
My wife isn't ready yet.

698
50:57.509 --> 50:59.400
But if you're uncomfortable...

699
51:00.266 --> 51:03.200
Yes, I'm uncomfortable.

700
51:05.266 --> 51:06.366
Since we've come all this way,

701
51:06.933 --> 51:08.566
let's just talk for a moment.

702
51:25.866 --> 51:27.019
Let me take this call.

703
51:27.019 --> 51:27.666
Yeah.

704
51:30.266 --> 51:32.400
Hello? What is it?

705
51:34.866 --> 51:35.666
Hey, Doc!

706
51:36.300 --> 51:37.100
What's wrong?

707
51:38.066 --> 51:39.266
Are you drunk?

708
51:39.733 --> 51:40.700
Where are you? I'll come get you.

709
51:41.066 --> 51:42.166
Okay, okay. I'm on my way.

710
51:43.466 --> 51:43.966
Yong.

711
51:43.966 --> 51:44.641
Huh?

712
51:44.641 --> 51:45.966
I have to go. Something urgent came up.

713
51:46.300 --> 51:48.600
Okay. I'll wait around here for Nant.

714
51:48.733 --> 51:51.266
Mm-hmm. I'm off. Keep an eye on her.

715
51:52.733 --> 51:53.933
Where's she rushing off to?

716
52:11.830 --> 52:15.299
Chat: (What are you up to?)

717
52:22.390 --> 52:31.539
Chat: (What's wrong?)

718
52:31.539 --> 52:34.567
Chat: (What's wrong?) Chat: (Can I call you?)

719
52:49.900 --> 52:52.800
Sorry, the number you have dialed...

720
53:04.266 --> 53:06.466
Hello, Ms. Chat. What can I do for you?

721
53:07.200 --> 53:11.166
Uh, I can't get hold of your friend.

722
53:12.066 --> 53:15.966
Oh, Nant is out on a paid dinner engagement tonight.

723
53:19.133 --> 53:22.700
Hello? Ms. Chat, can you hear me?

724
53:24.400 --> 53:27.327
Yes. Please send me the location.

725
53:27.327 --> 53:28.466
Thank you.

726
53:45.100 --> 53:46.866
Hey! What the hell is this?

727
53:48.100 --> 53:48.900
What is going on?

728
53:50.066 --> 53:51.366
Once the job is done,

729
53:51.766 --> 53:53.500
I'll transfer the rest of your payment.

730
53:55.666 --> 53:56.466
What is this?

731
53:59.766 --> 54:01.266
What are you talking about, dear?

732
54:01.900 --> 54:02.700
Well, today...

733
54:03.100 --> 54:04.966
Didn't we make a deal?

734
54:05.966 --> 54:06.766
What are you talking about?

735
54:08.866 --> 54:09.800
Come on.

736
54:10.466 --> 54:12.000
Don't talk to me like that.

737
54:12.566 --> 54:14.133
You're breaking my heart.

738
54:15.000 --> 54:17.866
I'm already paid the full amount upfront.

739
54:18.933 --> 54:19.766
Come on.

740
54:20.200 --> 54:21.733
Stop playing hard to get. Come here.

741
54:22.400 --> 54:23.200
Sit down.

742
54:23.700 --> 54:24.800
I'm not a hooker.

743
54:25.466 --> 54:26.466
With that much money,

744
54:26.766 --> 54:28.566
you could buy plenty of other women.

745
54:29.066 --> 54:30.866
Look, I'll transfer your money back.

746
54:31.133 --> 54:32.500
I'll transfer your money back right now.

747
54:35.366 --> 54:36.307
No need!

748
54:37.247 --> 54:40.245
I like it when you play hard to get.

749
54:41.656 --> 54:43.366
Hey! Bring her over here.

750
54:52.066 --> 54:53.026
Don't be difficult.

751
54:53.026 --> 54:54.166
Don't be difficult with me, okay?

752
54:55.166 --> 54:56.266
Stay still!

753
55:02.900 --> 55:03.700
Chat!

754
55:03.933 --> 55:04.566
Chat!

755
55:04.566 --> 55:05.400
Chat, help me!

756
55:06.766 --> 55:08.366
Did she said, 'Chat, help me?'

757
55:17.966 --> 55:19.333
Go upstairs and help Nant right now.

758
55:19.800 --> 55:20.600
No questions. Move!

759
55:20.800 --> 55:21.600
Go!

760
55:24.400 --> 55:25.200
Hey, you!

761
55:27.566 --> 55:28.366
Let's go.

762
55:35.066 --> 55:35.866
Help!

763
55:36.333 --> 55:37.133
Help!

764
55:37.133 --> 55:38.866
Hey. Stay still, beautiful.

765
55:40.100 --> 55:40.900
Help me!

766
55:41.200 --> 55:43.766
This is exactly how I like it.

767
55:43.966 --> 55:44.866
What are you doing?!

768
55:45.900 --> 55:46.700
Help me!

769
55:51.600 --> 55:52.605
Who the hell are you?!

770
55:52.605 --> 55:53.887
Quiet!

771
55:54.866 --> 55:55.733
Why are you arresting me?

772
55:55.866 --> 55:57.100
I haven't done anything wrong!

773
55:57.266 --> 55:58.746
I paid for her!

774
55:58.746 --> 55:59.492
You bastard!

775
55:59.493 --> 56:00.553
You scumbag!

776
56:01.558 --> 56:03.192
You disgusting old pervert!

777
56:03.933 --> 56:05.113
Attempted rape,

778
56:05.113 --> 56:06.982
unlawful detention,

779
56:06.982 --> 56:09.933
and most importantly, assaulting my girl.

780
56:12.595 --> 56:13.655
Yeah.

781
56:14.921 --> 56:16.921
What the hell can you do?

782
56:18.466 --> 56:19.304
Don't worry.

783
56:19.617 --> 56:22.200
I'll make sure you rot in prison.

784
56:22.201 --> 56:23.470
Take him away.

785
56:23.470 --> 56:24.530
Let go!

786
56:24.531 --> 56:26.113
Let me go!

787
56:26.113 --> 56:27.173
Hey!

788
56:27.237 --> 56:28.401
Do you know who I am?!

789
56:50.066 --> 56:50.805
Mr. Yong!

790
56:51.745 --> 56:54.800
Tell me what happened.

791
56:56.766 --> 56:57.431
Well...

792
56:58.215 --> 57:01.149
Her room was completely trashed.

793
57:01.880 --> 57:03.760
The landlord demanded compensation.

794
57:04.753 --> 57:05.955
She didn't have the money,

795
57:07.993 --> 57:09.694
so she took this job

796
57:09.694 --> 57:11.266
because she didn't want to trouble you.

797
57:14.366 --> 57:17.000
Her room was damaged? What a coincidence.

798
57:17.500 --> 57:18.766
I thought so too.

799
57:19.966 --> 57:22.001
And the person who hired her...

800
57:22.001 --> 57:23.478
wasn't this old man.

801
57:23.948 --> 57:27.500
It was another man named Wasu.

802
57:29.666 --> 57:32.133
I think there's a whole scheme behind all of this.

803
57:33.166 --> 57:35.766
I'll get to the bottom of it and make sure they all go to prison.

804
57:45.200 --> 57:46.366
Don't cry anymore.

805
57:47.700 --> 57:48.533
Are you okay?

806
57:49.966 --> 57:51.166
Does anything hurt?

807
57:55.600 --> 57:56.400
Nant...

808
57:57.300 --> 57:58.100
Look at me.

809
57:58.800 --> 58:00.066
I'm right here.

810
58:02.113 --> 58:03.281
Didn't I tell you...

811
58:05.059 --> 58:07.059
I'm the only one who can hire you.

812
58:12.542 --> 58:14.542
It's okay, it's okay.

813
58:14.546 --> 58:15.971
I'm here.

814
58:33.569 --> 58:35.569
I'm here now. It's going to be okay.

815
59:54.538 --> 59:59.397
Chat:(Find me a good private investigator for tomorrow.)

816
01:00:29.700 --> 01:00:31.593
I've been a lawyer for years,

817
01:00:31.593 --> 01:00:34.366
but this is the most despicable case I've ever seen.

818
01:00:34.733 --> 01:00:36.652
The moment I saw Nant's photo

819
01:00:36.652 --> 01:00:38.800
at that hotel, I nearly lost my mind.

820
01:00:39.566 --> 01:00:41.866
Wait, is Boss seeing someone?

821
01:00:42.333 --> 01:00:44.466
I can't even imagine what Boss would be like in a relationship.

822
01:00:45.200 --> 01:00:47.266
And after I've been so good to you...

823
01:00:48.200 --> 01:00:50.200
How do you think you should reward me?
